        "name": "Highlander",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Master Yi moves with unparalleled agility, temporarily increasing his Move Speed and Attack Speed as well as making him immune to all slowing effects. While active, Champion kills or assists extend Highlander's duration. Passively reduces cooldown for his other abilities on a kill or assist.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Champion takedowns reduce the remaining Cooldown of Master Yi's basic Abilities by 70%.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Master Yi enters a trance, gaining <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">35/45/55% Move Speed</span>, <span>25/45/65% Attack Speed</span>, and immunity to <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> for 7 seconds. Champion takedowns extend the duration of this Ability by 7 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The duration of <span>Highlander</span> is paused during <span>Alpha Strike</span> and <span>Meditate</span></span>",
